OL,5,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,6,     FFive years after the unexpected
OL,7,     Fdeath of his girlfriend in 2006,
OL,8,     FRobert Trigg calls 999 to report
OL,9,     Fanother unexplained death - that
OL,10,     Fof his new girlfriend.
OL,11,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,12,     FWhen a man was suddenly stabbed to
OL,13,     Fdeath by a stranger one night,
OL,14,     Fauthorities began three decades of
OL,15,     Frelentless policework to discover
OL,16,     Fthe culprit.
OL,17,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,18,     FThe casualty department is full,
OL,19,     Fbut ambulances are still bringing
OL,20,     Fin critically ill patients,
OL,21,     Fincluding a husband who was found
OL,22,     Fcollapsed on the floor.
